- Who / what / where  
- Use storytelling (not bullet explanation)

---

*ဘာကြောင့်အရေးကြီးလဲ?*  
- Real-world impact  
- Compare with something familiar (Myanmar context if possible)

---

*နောက်ကွယ်က Tech / Science*  
- Explain simply  
- Use analogies (VERY IMPORTANT)
- Add English terms (with Burmese explanation)

---

*ရှေ့ဆက်ဘာဖြစ်နိုင်လဲ?*  
- Future possibilities  
- Risks / opportunities  
- Make reader think

---

📌 Ending (2–3 lines)  
