      `  "topic": "The specific topic chosen",`,
      `  "content": "The main text content of the post formatted with Telegram Markdown",`,
      `  "hashtags": ["#tag1", "#tag2"]`,
      `}`,
      `Do NOT wrap the JSON in markdown blocks (e.g. \`\`\`json). Output ONLY the raw JSON string.`,
    ].join('\n');